Z||000033||SloPonti||09-13-2000||08:47 PM||||well i guess i have to say it again haze-i was not talking to you and you only-it was the whole show-i am in no way upset in the award that i won-i am glad i got onne-there were many fieros there that did not get a award that were very nice-in fact look at the G class- about 15 almost near perfect 86-88 gt's and only three one-this is were i am upset with the trunk and hood open thing-like i said it was hard to judge a fiero if you cannot see the whole thing-i also like my fiero with both of these item down-the fiero looks much sleeker and faster with them down but you cannot give an accurent judge with them down-that is all i am saying so stop getting so bent out of shape over something that is not worth it! i love your fiero as well as everyone elses-i would really love to have your wheels-but i am also very very very happy with my car and that is all that matters-well anyway don't always assume that because someone says something that they are talking about you!!!<BR>thanks<BR>Rob||||reg||1
