Z||000038||TheFiero64||09-14-2000||03:07 PM||||I just started entering shows. one show so far. I will enter the FOCONE show next weekend. I have worked extremely hard on my car. It looks great for a car I picked up for $400, but it is not yet a show stopper. I need to do paint and leather seats next, But don't have the cash for it. I have already put myself into debt for my Fiero passion  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">. I think that the cars that should win are the ones that have had the hardest work put into them. I am glad no matter who wins because I know that if I keep working on mine I will win someday.  <P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/TheFiero64_signature1.gif"> ||||reg||10
